    (uuid "cce2ed54-de9a-5bda-8e44-4888047294bf"))
  (text "3-1, section 9)"
    (at 15.24 36.68 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.6 1.6))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e0030253-8144-5871-8018-83a8e545bf1f"))
  (text "3V3: 22 uF + 2x 0.1 uF (datasheet peripheral schematic). EN: 10 k + 1 uF RC (datasheet section 9)."
    (at 15.24 39.88 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "a600888e-7595-5dd1-b92a-00c9715daa0a"))
  (text "Strapping: GPIO0 10 k up (BOOT button to GND), GPIO3 10 k up, GPIO45 10 k down, GPIO46 100 k down (at Q3)."
    (at 15.24 43.08 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "eb1f4d12-5f4b-590d-981e-c2b185538426"))
  (text "GPIO1 is spare (test point). DShot outputs have 100 k pull-downs (motor stopped during reset) and 1 k series"
    (at 15.24 46.28 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "fe225be3-aa3a-5a3d-9d38-2f5824541fd0"))
  (text "resistors that limit current into an unpowered ESC MCU (e.g. USB-only power). GPIO48 reaches KILL through D5."
    (at 15.24 49.48 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6c237c24-1cf9-519f-aefa-357df0e297dc"))
